parallel_db_adapter <|.. mysql_adapter : implements

parallel_fs_adapter <|.. posix_fs_adapter : implements
parallel_fs_adapter <|.. win32_fs_adapter : implements

Core --> MQAdapters : defines base
Core --> RESTAdapters : defines base
Core --> DBAdapters : defines base
Core --> FSAdapters : defines base
